    <string name="faq_a_devices">As many as your plan allows. Profile shows how many are signed in; you can sign one out there, or when signing in on a new phone.</string>
    <string name="faq_a_iran">With \u201cBypass Iranian sites\u201d on (Settings → Routing), Iranian sites connect directly: many do not open from abroad, and this way they do not use your plan\u2019s traffic. You can switch it off.</string>
    <string name="faq_a_logs">The app does not record the sites you visit. Its connection log holds only connection events, stays on your phone, and you can clear it.</string>
    <string name="faq_a_pay">As soon as the payment is confirmed, the service is set up within a minute and appears on Home.</string>
    <string name="faq_a_slow">Open Servers, tap refresh to measure every server, and pick the one with the lowest ping. Servers far from you, or busy at that hour, are slower.</string>
